{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QPet Zoo is a cartoon stylized idle-zoo simulator designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while caring for your zoo and animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bBottom-Screen Design:\u200b\u200b Allows for effortless play while you work or study.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bVarious Animal Selection:\u200b\u200b Choose and raise various cute animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bEnhanced Animal Interaction:\u200b\u200b Interact with cute animal pets to earn more coins and profits, expanding your zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Decorations :\u200b\u200b Various fun decorations and environmental effects help you create your own pretty zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bBackgrounds:\u200b\u200b Choose from different zoo background environments to suit your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bOptimized Resource Usage:\u200b\u200b Engineered for minimal computer resource consumption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200bCompatibility:\u200b\u200b Compatible with other software and live wallpapers (can run concurrently).</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894730/a6c38321356ecdbd8078e2189fb33fe4f002d103.jpg"},{"name":"Sheep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894730/a98ddb62b6ab9ad9a71d2d4bc31b2656a21d6998.jpg"},{"name":"Rabbit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894730/abb2ec472fe1a5e41acc9158e7a183659cade75f.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894730/f674455a0f1afe400f2ada50addfa1fbee6eb26